@wrangler classic workwear jeans are cleaning up nicely. Created exclusively for @wildlifetailor, the relaxed double knees swap standard reinforcement panels for washable cow suede, adding a luxe touch without losing their practicality.⁠
⁠
Available in black and indigo from August 1.

@oakley isn’t simply dropping a new pair of shades. It built them an entire sci-fi origin story.⁠
⁠
The brand’s new Infiniloop model is based on eyewear worn by Jupiter in Book 2 of its post-apocalyptic Future Genesis comic, where the frames help him navigate a storm-ravaged wasteland. In reality, Oakley translates that fictional gear through a futuristic fusion of titanium and O-Matter.

@patagonia Retro-X was already about as close to fleece perfection as it gets. Now, its latest version covers the outdoor classic in swirls of orange, blue, and pastel yellow, turning it into something resembling a fluffy de Kooning painting.⁠
⁠
The catch? It’s only available in women’s sizing. Still, a size label shouldn’t stand between anyone and a great fleece.

@Zendaya nuova Global Ambassador di #PradaParadoxe, il profumo che la maison descrive come celebrazione di un’identità multiforme e libera da definizioni. La campagna, diretta dal premio Oscar Barry Jenkins, porta con sé la frase “Mai uguale, ma sempre me stessa” e viene lanciata insieme a Prada Paradoxe Sweet Chemistry Eau de Parfum.
Photo: Prada Beauty
#PradaBeauty #Zendaya #LOfficiel

@Goldengoose just opened its first ever store in Mumbai at Palladium Mall on December 11, marking the Italian luxury sneaker brand’s city debut and its third store in India after Delhi and Bengaluru.
To celebrate the launch, Golden Goose collaborated with @ManishMalhotra05 on an exclusive sneaker co-creation, merging Italian craftsmanship with Indian artistry.
The women’s sneaker featured white cream suede with delicate gold floral embroidery, while the men’s version showcased the same motifs on a sleek black suede base, balancing the brand’s distressed aesthetic with Malhotra’s signature opulence.
The Palladium store brings together Golden Goose’s full universe, from iconic sneakers to apparel and accessories, while introducing its immersive co-creation experience. Guests personalised their pairs alongside the brand’s Dream Makers using crystal charms, brooches, and interchangeable tongues, making each piece truly one of a kind.
Blending craftsmanship, imperfection, and cultural dialogue, the Mumbai opening marks a significant creative milestone for Golden Goose in India.
